t time and valid for 10 minutes. There is no previous step output that provides this value.\'}, {\'input_field\': \'session_id\', \'source_type\': \'from_previous_step\', \'source_step_id\': 1, \'source_output_field\': \'result.session_id\', \'generated_value\': None, \'reasoning\': "The session_id is allocated during the login process, which is in step 1. The output of step 1 includes \'result.session_id\', which matches the required \'session_id\' input parameter."}, {\'input_field\': \'name\', \'source_type\': \'generated\', \'source_step_id\': None, \'source_output_field\': None, \'generated_value\': \'test_user\', \'reasoning\': "The name of the user is not provided by any previous step. It must be generated. A common default value for testing purposes is \'test_user\'."}], \'output\': [{\'name\': \'code\', \'type\': \'integer\', \'description\': \'response code, zero for success, non-zero for errors\'}, {\'name\': \'message\', \'type\': \'string\', \'description\': \'response message, description for the response code\'}]}]\n</PARAMS>\n\nPARAMS中每个step的结构如下:\n\n{\n  "step_id": int,\n  "description": str,\n  "guidance": str,\n  "input": [\n    {\n      "input_field": "string",\n      "source_type": "from_previous_step | generated",\n      "source_step_id": "int | null",\n      "source_output_field": "string | null",\n      "generated_value": "any | null",\n      "reasoning": "string"\n    }\n  ],\n  "output": [\n    {\n      "name": "str",\n      "type": "int",\n      "description": "testcase instance id"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n\n## 二、目标测试用例整体结构规范（必须严格遵守）\n\n最终输出的测试用例必须是一个 JSON 对象，并且 **顶层必须包含以下字段**：\n\n{\n  "name": "Simple testcase",\n  "demand": "testcase v0.0.0",\n  "tester": "XRT Darpeng",\n  "steps": [ ... ]\n}\n\n---\n\n## 三、目标测试步骤（steps）结构输出规范\n\n生成后的steps 中的每一个元素必须符合以下结构（字段齐全，层级一致）：\n\n{\n  "step": number,\n  "description": string,\n  "guidance": string,\n  "input": [\n    {\n      "name": string,\n      "type": string,\n      "description": string\n    }\n  ],\n  "output": [\n    {\n      "name": string,\n      "type": string,\n      "description": string\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n\n---\n\n### 四、修改原则（必须严格遵守）\n1. "name"、"demand"、"tester" 字段必须存在，且不改变其值\n2. "steps" 必须是一个有序数组，表示测试执行步骤，内容参考PARAMS\n3. 目标测试用例中input参数列表中每个参数的description字段根据PARAMS中input参数列表中对应参数的source_type，source_step_id，source_output_field，generated_value这四个字段生成\n4. **只做结构与表达层面的修改**\n   - 允许：格式补全\n   - 不允许：引入新的测试步骤、新的测试数据\n\n5. **测试语义保持完全一致**\n   - 每个步骤的输入、操作、预期含义不得改变\n\n6. **对齐标准格式**\n   - 层级结构与标准格式一致\n\n7. 目标测试用例的step字段的值应设置为从0开始递增\n---\n\n### 三、输出要求\n\n1. 仅输出【修改后的测试用例】, 不要输出任何解释、分析、对比说明或多余文本\n2. 输出必须是合法的 JSON，可被程序直接解析\n\n---\n\n### 四、输出示例风格（仅作参考）\n- 使用清晰、正式、测试文档风格的描述\n- 避免口语化或推理性语言\n\n---\n\n现在请开始修改测试用例。'}]}}
